{"id":"wb-7-797","name":"北马玉皇庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"北马玉皇庙","text":"北马玉皇庙，位于山西省晋城市陵川县附城镇北马村。\n玉皇庙面阔五间，进深六椽，悬山顶，具金代风格。\n2013年3月5日，北马玉皇庙公布为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8C%97%E9%A9%AC%E7%8E%89%E7%9A%87%E5%BA%99","revisionId":86856765,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86856765","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":null}